<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:red;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:red;text-transform:
uppercase'>Ребята
ловят <span class="GramE">кайф</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<h1><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Б.
Гребенщиков<o:p></o:p></span></h1>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Вступление:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Em</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'> – 2</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">    </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Вытри
слёзы, если
есть ещё
слёзы<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:1">      </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:2">         </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Значит
то, что
случилось не
так уж плохо.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>Вытри
кровь. Их не
догонишь.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>А
если
догонишь, то
может быть
хуже.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'> <span style="mso-tab-count:4">                     </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span><span class="SpellE">Hm</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>Мы
всегда
гордились
тем, что мы <span class="GramE">вне</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:2">          </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Нам
повезло - мы
остались
живы<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:2">          </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Мы
могли бы
стоять лицом
к стене,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>А
это просто,
это просто<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span>С<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span>Dm<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span>Em </span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>G<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Ребята,
ребята ловят,
ребята ловят
свой <span class="GramE">кайф</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span>С<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span>Dm<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span>Em </span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>G<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Ребята,
ребята ловят,
ребята ловят
свой <span class="GramE">кайф</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span>С<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           
</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Dm<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span>Em </span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>G<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Ребята,
ребята ловят,
ребята ловят
свой <span class="GramE">кайф</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="DE" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:DE'>: C Am Dm Em G<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="DE" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
DE'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
нет
прекрасней
дружбы
мужчин;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Один
за всех и все
как каждый.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Плечом
к плечу. Нам
вместе не
стыдно.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
смерть всем
тем, кто идёт
не с нами<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>Мы –
это ваше
светлое
завтра<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Hm</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Наши
ботинки
подкованы
сталью<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                 
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>У
наших
девушек
сломаны лица<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                
</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
